  "prefLabel": "Rev 901.02 Association",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 901.02 “Association” means an unincorporated group of 2 or more persons that is not a legal entity separate from the persons who compose it.\n\nSource. # 10795, eff 3-11-15; ss by #13433, eff 8-12-22",
